### Fluxo completo da API em ambiente local (Development).
### Execute as requisições em ordem; os valores são capturados das respostas anteriores.

@api = http://localhost:5013

### 1. Token de administrador (abre contas)
# @name admin
POST {{api}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "admin", "roles": ["accounts-admin"] }

### 2. Token da titular
# @name alice
POST {{api}}/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subject": "alice" }

### 3. Abrir conta com saldo inicial
# @name account
POST {{api}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerId": "alice", "initialBalance": 100.00 }

### 4. Crédito (repetir esta requisição devolve o mesmo lançamento com Idempotent-Replayed: true)
# @name credit
POST {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pedido-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 50.25, "currency": "BRL", "description": "depósito" }

### 5. Mesma chave com outro conteúdo: 409
POST {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pedido-001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 99.00, "currency": "BRL" }

### 6. Débito acima do saldo: 422 insufficient_funds
POST {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pedido-002
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "debit", "amount": 1000.00, "currency": "BRL" }

### 7. Consultar o lançamento
GET {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/entries/{{credit.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 8. Saldo atual
GET {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 9. Saldo no instante do crédito (fuso explícito obrigatório)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/balance?at={{credit.response.body.$.recordedAt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 10. Consolidação diária (requer o worker rodando para estar em dia)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/accounts/{{account.response.body.$.id}}/daily-balances?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 11. Health checks
GET {{api}}/health/ready

###
GET {{api}}/health/projection
